@title Cooling advice: sweep vent and fan places, show the best few, add one to Vents and fans
@area Heat
# A hot cabinet (VFD under PLC modules). Pictures first show the three ways in (Heat strip button, Ctrl+K entry, plate right-click). The sweep tries places and sizes in the 2D model; the window shows the best options with before and after; Add puts the pair in the 3D Heat panel's Vents and fans list, and the window closes when the view changes.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-cooling-advice.novo
wait 30
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text Show or hide heat
wait 6
key Enter
wait 20
expect "Cooling advice"
shot heat-strip-button
click 960 520 right
wait 10
expect "Cooling advice…"
shot plate-right-click
key Escape
wait 6
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text Cooling advice
wait 8
expect "Cooling advice and vent sweep"
shot ctrl-k-entry
key Enter
wait 20
shot sweeping
wait_s 90
expect "Cooling advice"
expect "Model estimate"
expect "Tightest margin"
expect "A try is one run"
shot advice
check_layout
click_text "Add these two to Vents and fans"
wait 10
expect "Added"
shot added
click_text 3D #1
wait 40
expect_not "Model estimate"
expect "Grille, in the left wall"
expect "Fan, in the left wall"
shot in-3d
check_layout
